codex
I’m testing a more targeted use of multiple direction sets: precompute two setup-seeded QMC sets, run only the first layer for both, choose the one whose sampled first-layer mean best matches the exact first-layer mean, and then propagate that set. It costs one extra first-layer pass but uses an allowed exact control signal.
